OL,3,GNEWSATeen with own flock of sheep wins
OL,4,Afarming award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old girl who has her own
OL,7,Fflock of sheep has been recognised at a
OL,8,Fceremony celebrating the next
OL,9,Fgeneration of British farmers.
OL,11,FMacie from Dartmouth in Devon was named
OL,12,FYoung Farmers' Club Junior Member of
OL,13,Fthe Year, in the under 18 category, at
OL,14,Fthe Young British Farming Awards 2026.
OL,16,FThe teenager has been involved with
OL,17,Fyoung farmers since she was nine - and
OL,18,Fnow has her own flock of nearly 70
OL,19,Fsheep. Judges praised her "impressive
OL,20,Fmark" on young farmers.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
