OL,3,GNEWSATeen with own flock of sheep wins
OL,4,Afarming award
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacie, who became a club chairman at
OL,7,Fthe age of 13, said she had "no idea"
OL,8,Fshe was nominated, adding "I'm pretty
OL,9,Fsure it was my mum".
